---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Wrongful Death Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Lost a loved one due to negligence in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps families pursue wrongful death claims. Call (415) 360-5266 for a free consultation."
  canonical="/wrongful-death-lawyer-san-francisco/"
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark via-dark to-slate-900/80"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Wrongful Death Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Losing a loved one due to someone else's negligence is a devastating experience. While no amount of compensation can replace your loss, a wrongful death claim can provide financial stability and hold the responsible parties accountable.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Wrongful death occurs when a person dies as a result of someone else's negligent, reckless, or intentional conduct. In California, surviving family members may bring a wrongful death claim to recover compensation for their loss. These claims can arise from a wide range of circumstances, including car accidents, medical malpractice, workplace accidents, defective products, and violent acts. The legal process is designed to provide financial support to grieving families and hold wrongdoers accountable.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">At The Sulfab Law Office, we approach wrongful death cases with compassion and determination. We understand the profound emotional and financial toll that the loss of a family member can cause. Our San Francisco wrongful death attorney works closely with you and your family to handle every aspect of the legal process, from investigating the circumstances of the death to negotiating with insurance companies and litigating in court when necessary.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Experience Matters</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compassionate Legal Guidance for Wrongful Death Claims</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Wrongful death cases require a thorough investigation and a deep understanding of California's wrongful death statutes. Our San Francisco wrongful death lawyer works with forensic experts, medical professionals, economists, and accident reconstruction specialists to build a comprehensive case. We gather evidence to establish liability and calculate the full extent of your family's losses, including both economic damages and the non-economic value of the relationship you have lost.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">We handle every aspect of the legal process, allowing you to focus on grieving and healing. From filing the initial claim to negotiating with insurance companies and, if necessary, presenting your case at trial, we are with you every step of the way. Our firm is committed to pursuing justice on behalf of your loved one and securing the financial resources your family needs to move forward.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">We are dedicated to helping families hold wrongdoers accountable and ensuring that those who have lost a loved due to negligence receive the full compensation they are entitled to under California law.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Types of Cases</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Circumstances That Can Lead to Wrongful Death Claims</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Wrongful death claims can arise from many different situations where negligence or intentional conduct causes a preventable death.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Car accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Truck accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Motorcycle accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Pedestrian accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Bicycle accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">DUI and drunk driving incidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Workplace accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Construction site accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Medical malpractice</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Defective products</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Dangerous property conditions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Nursing home neglect</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Premises liability incidents</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Legal Rights</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Who Can File a Wrongful Death Claim in California</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Under California law, the right to file a wrongful death claim is limited to specific family members. Surviving spouses, domestic partners, children, and grandchildren of the deceased may bring a claim. If there are no surviving spouse, partner, or children, other dependents such as parents, siblings, or other next of kin may be eligible to file. The personal representative of the deceased's estate may also bring a separate survival action to recover damages the deceased could have claimed had they lived.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">California law imposes a strict two-year statute of limitations for wrongful death claims, although certain circumstances may shorten that deadline. It is essential to act promptly to preserve your legal rights. Our San Francisco wrongful death attorney can help determine whether you are eligible to file a claim, identify all potential defendants, and ensure that your claim is filed within the applicable time frame.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">If you have lost a loved one due to someone else's negligence, we encourage you to contact our office to discuss your legal options. We offer a free consultation to help you understand your rights and the potential value of your claim.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Investigation</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">The Importance of a Thorough Investigation</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Building a strong wrongful death case requires a comprehensive investigation to establish liability and calculate damages. Our legal team works with a network of experts, including accident reconstruction specialists, medical examiners, economists, and vocational experts, to gather evidence and build a compelling case. We review police reports, medical records, employment history, and financial documentation to ensure that every aspect of your loss is properly documented.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">We also work diligently to identify all potentially liable parties. In a wrongful death case, multiple defendants may share responsibility, including negligent drivers, trucking companies, medical providers, property owners, and product manufacturers. By pursuing claims against all responsible parties, we maximize the compensation available to your family and ensure that those at fault are held fully accountable under the law.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Our firm is committed to pursuing justice on behalf of your loved one and ensuring that your family receives the compensation needed to achieve financial stability and closure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation Available in a Wrongful Death Claim</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">California law allows surviving family members to recover compensation for both the economic and non-economic losses resulting from the death of a loved one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical and Funeral Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coverage for medical treatment received prior to death, funeral and burial costs, and other end-of-life expenses incurred by surviving family members.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Lost Income and Benefits</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for the wages, employment benefits, and financial support the deceased would have provided to their family had they lived, including future earning potential.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Loss of Companionship and More</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for the loss of love, companionship, guidance, and emotional support, as well as the pain and suffering experienced by surviving family members.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Contact a Wrongful Death Lawyer in San Francisco Today</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If you have lost a loved one due to someone else's negligence, do not wait. Contact Sulfab Law Office today for a free, compassionate consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
